<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-CRUZEIRO WIN LIBERTADORES CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CRUZEIRO WIN LIBERTADORES CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BELO HORIZONTE, Brazil 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cruzeiro</p>
<p>(Brazil) beat Sporting Cristal (Peru) 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in</p>
<p>the second leg of the South Amnerican Libertadores Cup final</p>
<p>on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Elivelton (75)</p>
<p>Attendance: 95,472</p>
<p>Cruzeiro win 1-0 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
